{
  "bodyHash": "4b72defa97993de7",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">✨讓你的《我的世界》世界變得像蜂巢一樣美豔🐝</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>為你的遊戲增添一些獨特的自定義蜜蜂圖像。</em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br>這些紋理會根據季節自動改變（可以關閉）<span style=\"font-size:8px\"><br></span><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sapling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌱要使這個模組正常工作，需要先安裝Sapling模組&nbsp;🌱</span><br></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚙️此客戶端和服務器都需要安裝才能與朋友看到相同的紋理&‌#12426;&amp;#12594;&amp;#12460;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/330/seasonal-bee-banners-04.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/331/seasonal-bee-banners-05.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/493/the-holiday-bee-collection-banners-01.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/494/the-holiday-bee-collection-banners-02.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蜜蜂的變化在全球各地隨機生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">當你重新進入世界時，蜜蜂將保持它們的皮膚！把它們全部收集起來吧！&amp;#12426;&amp;#12594;&amp;#12460;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌸☀️🍂❄️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這些紋理會按季節自動改變。同時會有常規的蜜蜂。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">季節日期：日 - 月</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌸春季:&nbsp; 01-03 / 31-5&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☀️夏季: 01-06 / 31-8&nbsp; </span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 🍂秋季:&nbsp; 01-09 / 30-11&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❄️冬季: &nbsp;01-12 / 28-2 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🎄聖誕節: 01-12 / 26-12</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這裡還有一個增加命令來選擇您喜歡的半球！北方或南方😊 <br>(預設選擇北方)</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> ‼️🏷️如果您想在整年內都保留特定蜜蜂的特定紋理，請在新季節開始之前為他們命名！否則，它們會變化。‼️🏷️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>命令<br></strong><em>⚙️</em><em>以自定義您的體驗。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>管理員工具</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee </span>adminTools flipSeasonDatesToOtherHemisphere&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>| 轉換半球</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> adminTools resetAllLoadedEntityTextures&nbsp;&nbsp; |&nbsp; <em>重置在遊戲中加載的所有蜜蜂紋理</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> adminTools reloadConfigFile&nbsp; | <em>重新加載配置更改</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>配置文件值</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> setConfigValues showCurrentValues</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee </span>setConfigValues disableSeasonsDuringHoliday (false/true)&nbsp; | <em>選項以禁用假期和季節性紋理的混合物</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee </span>setConfigValues nameTagPreventsTexture (false/true)&nbsp; | <em>保存使用標籤紋理或禁用它的選項</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> /maplemods bee setConfigValues replaceSeasonalTextures &nbsp;|<em> 做出更改後重新加載紋理。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>更新類別設置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> updateCategorySettings _default&nbsp;&nbsp; | <em>禁用或啟用原始蜜蜂紋理</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee </span>updateCategorySettings <em>&lt;category&gt;</em> (disable/enable/setDate)&nbsp; | <em>自定義季節</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>更新紋理設置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee </span>updateTextureSettings <em>&lt;texture&gt;</em> (disable/enable) | <em>明確選擇要啟用或禁用的紋理</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">終於設計並推出我的自定義蜜蜂。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✨希望您和我一樣喜歡看它們飛來飛去 ✨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">季節性紋理也適用：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-chicken-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">小雞群！ 🐥</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-creeper-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">炸彈人！💚</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-rabbit-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">兔子群！ 🐰</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-frog-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">青蛙群！ 🐸</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-parrot-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鸚鵡群！ 🦜</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-pig-collection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">豬群！ 🐷</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更多生物即將推出！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>",
